#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:248
msgid ""
"Training exposes additional learning, video, sensor capture, and convergence"
" options. Training and play also expose ``backend_args`` for options that "
"truly belong to one RL library. Use typed fields, presets, and "
"``hydra_args`` for supported options. ``backend_args`` bypasses the common "
"request contract. See the :mod:`isaaclab.benchmark` API reference for the "
"exhaustive field list."
msgstr ""
"训练还提供学习、视频、传感器采集与收敛相关选项。训练和回放也提供 ``backend_args`` "
"，用于确实只属于某个强化学习库的选项。受支持选项应优先使用带类型的字段、预设和 ``hydra_args`` 。 ``backend_args`` "
"绕过通用请求约定。完整字段列表见 :mod:`isaaclab.benchmark` API 参考。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:254
msgid ""
"An empty ``visualizers`` tuple explicitly disables every visualizer. "
"``None`` preserves task and environment defaults. Enabling cameras, "
"rendering, livestreaming, deterministic behavior, or animation recording "
"changes the workload and must be kept identical across compared runs."
msgstr ""
"空的 ``visualizers`` 元组显式禁用全部可视化器； ``None`` "
"保留任务与环境的默认设置。启用相机、渲染、实时串流、确定性行为或动画录制会改变负载，比较的运行必须保持这些设置一致。"

