#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:321
msgid ""
"The common ``run``, ``versions``, and ``hardware`` fields carry the "
"comparison context. ``runtime`` separates collection throughput, total "
"throughput, startup time, and environment-step timing. For measurement "
"definitions, see :ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_run`. See the public API"
" reference for every schema field."
msgstr ""
"通用的 ``run`` 、 ``versions`` 和 ``hardware`` 字段保存比较所需的上下文。 ``runtime`` "
"区分采集吞吐量、总吞吐量、启动时间和环境步计时。测量定义见 :ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_run` "
"；所有数据结构字段见公共 API 参考。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:328
msgid "Handle errors and process lifetime"
msgstr "处理错误与进程生命周期"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:330
msgid ""
"If a workflow parser rejects a typed request, the API raises ``ValueError``."
" If a workflow exits without returning a result, the API raises "
"``RuntimeError``. Invalid output configuration also raises an error. "
"Examples include an empty formatter tuple and an unknown formatter."
msgstr ""
"如果工作流解析器拒绝带类型请求，API 抛出 ``ValueError`` ；如果工作流退出却没有返回结果，则抛出 ``RuntimeError`` "
"。无效输出配置也会报错，例如格式化器元组为空或包含未知名称。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:335
msgid ""
"Run each workflow in a separate process. This gives each benchmark a clean "
"simulator lifecycle and prevents state from carrying over between workflows."
" It also matches the CLI execution model. Process startup is reported "
"separately from steady-state throughput. Save "
"``result.bundle.checkpoint_path`` before starting playback."
msgstr ""
"每个工作流应在独立进程中运行，使各性能测试拥有完整、独立的仿真器生命周期，避免状态在工作流之间遗留，也与命令行执行模型一致。进程启动时间与稳态吞吐量分别报告。开始回放前，先保存"
" ``result.bundle.checkpoint_path`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:343
msgid ""
"``measure_synchronized_step_breakdown=True`` inserts device synchronizations"
" around environment and simulation step boundaries. This serializes work and"
" changes the schedule being measured, especially on Newton. Every rate from "
"that run is diagnostic and must not be reported as throughput. Time outside "
"``SimulationContext.step()`` includes required action, actuator, state, "
"manager, reset, wrapper, and synchronization work. It is not equivalent to "
"removable Isaac Lab overhead."
msgstr ""
"``measure_synchronized_step_breakdown=True`` "
"在环境与仿真步边界插入设备同步。这会使计算串行化，改变被测调度，Newton 尤其明显。该次运行的所有速率均属诊断数据，不能作为吞吐量报告。 "
"``SimulationContext.step()`` 之外的时间包含必要的动作、执行器、状态、管理器、重置、包装器和同步工作，不能直接视为可移除的 "
"Isaac Lab 开销。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:352
msgid "Add a custom producer"
msgstr "添加自定义数据生成器"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:354
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.BaseIsaacLabBenchmark` when a producer's "
"lifecycle cannot be represented by a supported workflow. The framework "
"provides phases, typed measurement and metadata records, system recorders, "
"and formatters. You must define the timing boundary."
msgstr ""
"如果数据生成器的生命周期无法用受支持的工作流表示，可使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.BaseIsaacLabBenchmark` "
"。框架提供阶段、带类型的测量与元数据记录、系统记录器和格式化器，但计时边界必须由你定义。"

