#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:378
msgid ""
"This executable example measures a CPU workload, records the sample "
"distribution and configuration, updates system recorders, and always "
"finalizes the benchmark:"
msgstr "以下可执行示例测量 CPU 负载，记录样本分布与配置，更新系统记录器，并确保最终完成性能测试的收尾："

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:434
msgid ""
"Choose a meaningful phase name and state units explicitly. Warm up before "
"sampling. Report the sample count with the mean and standard deviation. For "
"GPU work, state whether the metric is submission latency or synchronized "
"completion latency. Place synchronization at deliberate boundaries."
msgstr ""
"选择有意义的阶段名，并明确单位。采样前先预热，报告均值与标准差时同时报告样本数。对于 GPU "
"计算，说明指标是提交延迟，还是设备同步后的完成延迟，并有意识地选择同步边界。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:439
msgid ""
"When a custom producer creates one of the stable workflow bundles, call "
"``attach_bundle(bundle)`` before ``finalize()`` and select ``schema``. "
"Otherwise, use the lower-level ``json`` representation. ``finalize()`` stops"
" optional Kit frametime recorders and gathers recorder data. It writes every"
" selected formatter and returns the paths written."
msgstr ""
"自定义数据生成器创建稳定工作流结果包时，应先调用 ``attach_bundle(bundle)`` ，再调用 ``finalize()`` ，并选择 "
"``schema`` 。否则，使用底层 ``json`` 表示。 ``finalize()`` 停止可选的 Kit "
"帧耗时记录器，收集记录器数据，写入所有选定格式，并返回写入路径。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:445
msgid ""
"With ``use_recorders=True`` (the default), the base class captures CPU, GPU,"
" memory, and version metadata. Call ``update_manual_recorders()`` at least "
"once before ``finalize()``, and update during long workloads when current "
"utilization samples are needed."
msgstr ""
"``use_recorders=True`` （默认值）时，基类采集 CPU、GPU、内存及版本元数据。在 ``finalize()`` 前至少调用一次"
" ``update_manual_recorders()`` ；长时间负载需要当前利用率样本时，也应在运行中更新。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:450
msgid ""
"Set ``frametime_recorders=True`` only when a Kit application is running and "
"the workload needs physics, render, application, or GPU frametime data. The "
"framework enables the available Isaac Sim benchmark services and skips "
"unavailable recorders. Frametime instrumentation is part of the workload. "
"Keep its setting fixed across comparisons."
msgstr ""
"只有 Kit 应用正在运行，且负载需要物理、渲染、应用或 GPU 帧耗时数据时，才设置 ``frametime_recorders=True`` "
"。框架启用可用的 Isaac Sim 性能测试服务，并跳过不可用记录器。帧耗时插桩本身也是负载的一部分，比较时应保持设置不变。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:457
msgid "Choose a lower-level runner"
msgstr "选择底层运行器"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:459
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.MethodBenchmarkRunner` repeats one method or "
"property across input modes, warm-up steps, and instance counts. Use "
":func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.measure_latency` to define paired host-submission"
" and device-synchronized timing boundaries. Use "
":class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.LatencyBenchmarkRunner` to report those "
"structured latency samples. Neither isolated result predicts end-to-end "
"environment or training throughput. The command matrices and extension "
"protocol are in :ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_micro`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.MethodBenchmarkRunner` "
"在不同输入模式、预热步数和实例数量下，重复运行某个方法或属性。使用 "
":func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.measure_latency` 定义成对的主机提交与设备同步计时边界；使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.LatencyBenchmarkRunner` "
"报告这些结构化延迟样本。这些单项结果都不能预测端到端环境或训练吞吐量。命令矩阵与扩展协议见 "
":ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_micro` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:469
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:471
msgid ""
"Run scripts through ``./isaaclab.sh -p`` so the Isaac Lab and simulator "
"Python environment is active. If output is missing, inspect returned "
"``output_paths`` and make sure custom producers call ``finalize()``. "
"Formatter names are lowercase and case-sensitive. Valid names are "
"``schema``, ``summary``, ``json``, ``osmo``, and ``omniperf``."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``./isaaclab.sh -p`` 运行脚本，确保 Isaac Lab 和仿真器 Python 环境已启用。如果缺少输出，检查返回的 "
"``output_paths`` ，确认自定义数据生成器调用了 ``finalize()`` 。格式化器名称使用小写且区分大小写，有效名称为 "
"``schema`` 、 ``summary`` 、 ``json`` 、 ``osmo`` 和 ``omniperf`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:477
msgid ""
"Missing GPU metadata usually means ``nvidia-smi`` or CUDA device discovery "
"is unavailable. Missing Kit frametime measurements can instead mean the "
"relevant benchmark service is not present. It does not invalidate non-"
"frametime phases."
msgstr ""
"缺少 GPU 元数据通常表示 ``nvidia-smi`` 或 CUDA 设备发现不可用。缺少 Kit "
"帧耗时测量，则可能是对应性能测试服务不存在，这并不影响非帧耗时阶段的有效性。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/benchmark_api.rst:481
msgid ""
"For a new supported end-to-end workflow, keep typed request construction, "
"dispatch, schema output, summary output, and CLI behavior aligned. For an "
"isolated operation, follow :ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_micro` before "
"adding a new runner or timing convention."
msgstr ""
"新增受支持的端到端工作流时，应保持带类型请求的构建、分派、schema 输出、摘要输出及命令行行为一致。对于单项操作，先参照 "
":ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_micro` ，再添加新运行器或计时约定。"
